# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# mona 통합 커맨드 — Stage2 v2 / Exp66 기준 (2026-06)
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# 배포 (minum에서):
#   mona-ship           코드 + .pt → soda 배포 + 서버 재시작
#   mona-ship --dry-run 할 일만 출력
#
# 실행 (soda에서):
#   mona-up             서버 + 허브 한 번에 시작 (= 한방 ON)
#   mona-down           서버 + 허브 모두 종료
#   mona-restart        mona-down + mona-up
#   mona-log            추론 서버 로그 실시간
#   mona-probe          /health + /recent 빠른 확인
#   mona-dryrun         STOP 로직 정적 이미지 테스트
#
# minum 원격 제어 (minum에서 soda를 한방에):
#   mona-remote-up      ssh soda "mona-up" 원격 실행
#   mona-remote-down    ssh soda "mona-down" 원격 실행
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

unalias mona-ship 2>/dev/null || true
mona-ship() { bash "${VLA_PROJECT_DIR}/scripts/deploy/ship.sh" "$@"; }

unalias mona-up 2>/dev/null || true
mona-up() {
    # 역할 자동 감지: soda(jetson role)면 로컬 실행, minum이면 원격 실행
    if [ "${VLA_SERVER_ROLE:-unknown}" = "jetson" ] || \
       [ "$(hostname 2>/dev/null)" = "fevers" ] || \
       [ "$(hostname 2>/dev/null)" = "encroaches" ]; then
        bash "${VLA_PROJECT_DIR}/scripts/run/go.sh" "$@"
    else
        # minum에서 호출 → soda에 원격 실행
        echo "minum → soda mona-up 원격 실행..."
        ssh soda@100.85.118.58 "source ~/MoNaVLA/.vla_aliases 2>/dev/null; bash ~/MoNaVLA/scripts/run/go.sh $*"
    fi
}

unalias mona-down 2>/dev/null || true
mona-down() {
    if [ "${VLA_SERVER_ROLE:-unknown}" = "jetson" ] || \
       [ "$(hostname 2>/dev/null)" = "fevers" ] || \
       [ "$(hostname 2>/dev/null)" = "encroaches" ]; then
        bash "${VLA_PROJECT_DIR}/scripts/run/go.sh" --stop
    else
        ssh soda@100.85.118.58 "bash ~/MoNaVLA/scripts/run/go.sh --stop"
    fi
}

unalias mona-restart 2>/dev/null || true
mona-restart() { mona-down; sleep 1; mona-up "$@"; }

unalias mona-log 2>/dev/null || true
mona-log() {
    local target="${1:-server}"
    case "$target" in
        hub)  tail -f "${VLA_PROJECT_DIR}/logs/hub.log" ;;
        *)    tail -f "${VLA_PROJECT_DIR}/logs/s2v2_server.log" ;;
    esac
}

unalias mona-probe 2>/dev/null || true
mona-probe() {
    local url="${VLA_API_SERVER:-http://localhost:8001}"
    echo "── health ──────────────────────────────────────"
    curl -sf "$url/health" | python3 -m json.tool 2>/dev/null || echo "서버 응답 없음"
    echo ""
    echo "── recent ──────────────────────────────────────"
    curl -sf "$url/recent" | python3 -m json.tool 2>/dev/null || echo "(없음)"
}

unalias mona-dryrun 2>/dev/null || true
mona-dryrun() {
    python3 "${VLA_PROJECT_DIR}/scripts/dryrun_stop_logic.py" "$@"
}

# minum → soda 원격 제어
unalias mona-remote-up 2>/dev/null || true
mona-remote-up() {
    ssh soda@100.85.118.58 "bash ~/MoNaVLA/scripts/run/go.sh $*"
}

unalias mona-remote-down 2>/dev/null || true
mona-remote-down() {
    ssh soda@100.85.118.58 "bash ~/MoNaVLA/scripts/run/go.sh --stop"
}

# vla-* 하위호환 (기존 레거시 유지)
vla-ship()   { mona-ship "$@"; }
vla-go()     { mona-up "$@"; }
vla-log()    { mona-log "$@"; }
vla-probe()  { mona-probe "$@"; }
vla-dryrun() { mona-dryrun "$@"; }

